==Problem description==
The device does not turn on when the power button is used. 

==Symptoms==

*Power LED stays off
*Both screens stay off
*There is no sound

== Diagnostic Steps ==
One or more part failures can lead to this problem. The symptoms differ slightly depending on what part is bad. Compare your device to the following table to find the most likely cause of this issue. All test are considered to be done with a known good battery. This table only applies when a good battery was used.
